 (PrepareCommitMsg)\n\nWhen scenario 2 is detected:\n```go\nif session.LastCheckpointID == \"\" && !shadowBranchExists(session.BaseCommit) {\n    // Claude might be committing mid-session\n    if session.TranscriptPath != \"\" {\n        newFiles, currentLines, err := ParseTranscriptForFiles(\n            session.TranscriptPath, \n            session.CondensedTranscriptLines,\n        )\n        if err == nil && len(newFiles) > 0 {\n            // Merge with existing FilesTouched for overlap check\n            allFiles := mergeFiles(session.FilesTouched, newFiles)\n            if hasOverlappingFiles(stagedFiles, allFiles) {\n                // Claude's work is being committed - generate new checkpoint ID\n                checkpointID = generateCheckpointID()\n                // Update session state with new files\n                session.FilesTouched = allFiles\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 4. Update FilesTouched on successful trailer addition\n\nWhen a new checkpoint ID is generated mid-session, update `FilesTouched` in session state so subsequent commits can do proper overlap checking.\n\n### Test Cases\n\n1. Claude commits before Stop → new checkpoint ID generated\n2. Claude commits, then commits again before Stop → second commit also gets new checkpoint ID\n3. Human commits unrelated files mid-session → no trailer\n4. Claude commits after Stop (existing flow) → reuses lastCheckpointId if files overlap\n\n### Files to Modify\n\n- `cmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit_types.go` - Add TranscriptPath to SessionState\n- `cmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit_hooks.go` - Store path in UserPromptSubmit, add check in PrepareCommitMsg\n- `cmd/entire/cli/hooks_claudecode_handlers.go` - Extract transcript parsing\n- `cmd/entire/cli/integration_test/` - Add test cases"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1320,"cache_read_input_tokens":77284,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1320,"